  "name": "深色空盆 2",
  "prompt": "六款明确不同造型的室内空花盆：方盆、圆盆、六角盆、桶盆、锥盆、板盆。每个花盆必须完全没有植物、没有泥土、没有石子、没有花、没有枝叶、没有装饰填充物，盆口清晰敞开并能看到空的内部。整体使用浅亮建筑参考场景中的深色普通材质，base color和vertex color只能使用#52362E、#714D48、#8E664D，主体优先#52362E，边缘或内壁可用#714D48和#8E664D。禁止黑色，禁止绿色，禁止任何色卡外颜色。低饱和深棕陶盆质感，干净完整，独立单体，道具比例统一。\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=2.2, height=1.4, depth=2.2 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.\nCreate variation 2 of 6; preserve the same reusable asset family while varying silhouette and details.",
